<!-- A fictional export that goes wrong in the ordinary ways a real one does:
     duplicate and invalid ids, a missing title, a query permalink, an unsafe
     link, a blocked shortcode, an image with no alt text, a file that is not an
     image, a trashed item, and a menu whose target this export does not carry.
     The corpus matrix runs the whole pipeline over it and checks that none of
     that turns into a crash, an invented page, or a leaked secret. -->
